    <label>Notify Operations On Lead Duplication</label>
    <protected>false</protected>
    <values>
        <field>Html_Body__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;

&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Duplicate Lead Blocked&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6;&quot;&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hello Operations Team,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
    A new lead creation attempt has been blocked because a duplicate lead already exists
    in the system with an &lt;strong&gt;Active&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;New&lt;/strong&gt; status.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
    As per the lead deduplication rules, the incoming lead was not created in the system.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Incoming Lead Details&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;8&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;
       style=&quot;border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #cccccc;&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;{0}&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Number&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;{1}&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;{2}&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
    Please review the existing lead if any further action is required.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
    Regards,&lt;br/&gt;
    CRM System
&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</value>
    </values>
